    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-status\"><header><strong>Mario Gabriele</strong></header><div class=\"tw-body\"><br>\"无模型的公司就像坐在流沙上。\"<br><br>Yash Patil（@ypatil125）是@appliedcompute 的创始人兼首席执行官，该公司在企业数据上训练定制模型并将其投入生产。<br><br>他的信念是：每个组织对“好”的定义都不尽相同，而一家不拥有自己模型的公司，离发现自己无法再做什么只有一步之遥。<br><br>( <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/mariogabriele/status/2069390013012602913?t=0\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">0:00</span></a> ) 介绍<br>押注于定制 AI 模型<br>( <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/mariogabriele/status/2069390013012602913?t=750\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">12:30</span></a> ) 亚什的早期影响和首个项目<br>( <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/mariogabriele/status/2069390013012602913?t=1169\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">19:29</span></a> ) 在 OpenAI 内部，山姆·奥特曼被解雇期间<br>亚什欣赏山姆·奥特曼的哪些方面<br>（  <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/mariogabriele/status/2069390013012602913?t=1783\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">29:43</span></a>  ）教模型进行推理<br>( <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/mariogabriele/status/2069390013012602913?t=2139\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">35:39</span></a> ) Applied Compute 背后的核心见解<br>为什么模型训练永远不会结束<br>( <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/mariogabriele/status/2069390013012602913?t=3085\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">51:25</span></a> ) Applied Compute 的文化与人员<br>( <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/mariogabriele/status/2069390013012602913?t=3828\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">1:03:48</span> ) 最终沉思\n\n感谢那些使这成为可能的合作伙伴\n</a><a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/mariogabriele/status/2069390013012602913?t=3828\"><span class=\"r-18u37iz\"> </span></a><a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/brexHQ\" dir=\"ltr\">@brexHQ</a> <br>: 智能金融平台。 <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://brex.com/mario\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\" aria-hidden=\"true\">http://</span>brex.com/mario</a> <br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/Guru_HQ\" dir=\"ltr\">@Guru_HQ</a> <br>: AI 的工作事实来源。 <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://getguru.com\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\" aria-hidden=\"true\">http://</span>getguru.com</a> <br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/withpersona\" dir=\"ltr\">@withpersona</a> <br>: 可信的身份核实适用于任何场景。 <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-